<title>USA: Christian Dalloz says to buy Pulsafe.</title>
<headline>Christian Dalloz says to buy Pulsafe.</headline>
<dateline>READING, Pa. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Christian Dalloz said on Monday that it reached an agreement to acquire Pulsafe Safety Products Ltd, the United Kingdom's largest maker of eye- protection equipment.</p>
<p>The terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Christian Dalloz said the acquisition would increase its sales by $21 million a year and its manufacturing facilities to a total of 13 worldwide.</p>
<p>Pulsafe also manufactures propietary respiratory equipment.</p>
</text>
